 ### Astrology engine
 
-`@zodiacs/engine` candidate version 0.1.1-rc.5 is the pure-TypeScript calculation sibling. It is browser-first, Node-compatible, ESM-only, synchronous, side-effect-free, and tree-shakeable. The core entry makes no network request. It computes apparent geocentric tropical positions, natal charts, transits, synastry, lunar phase, and Saturn-return seasons. Whole-sign and Placidus houses are supported; Placidus falls back to whole sign above 66° absolute latitude and returns the `polar-fallback` flag.
